    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Deactivate the FASTag or remove the tag before loading to prevent accidental toll charges during transit. Keep the tag in a sealed envelope with the transport documents. Upon delivery, reactivate the tag and verify the balance to resume smooth highway travel.</p>
